sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant L as Leader
    participant F1 as Follower 1
    participant F2 as Follower 2

    C->>L: Write command
    L->>F1: AppendEntries
    L->>F2: AppendEntries
    F1-->>L: Acknowledged
    F2-->>L: Acknowledged
    L->>L: Commit after quorum
    L-->>C: Success
